@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/venues/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "venueCode": "V-99",
  "name": "Testhalle",
  "street": "Testweg 1",
  "postalCode": "45127",
  "city": "Essen",
  "capacity": 300
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/venues
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "venueCode": "V-01",
  "name": "Testhalle",
  "street": "Testweg 1",
  "postalCode": "45127",
  "city": "Essen",
  "capacity": 300
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/venues/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venueCode": "V-01",
  "name": "Testhalle aktualisiert",
  "street": "Testweg 1",
  "postalCode": "45127",
  "city": "Essen",
  "capacity": 300
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/venues/999999
